.SH SERVICE MANAGEMENT
.TP
Check agent status:
.B systemctl status luciverse-<agent>
.TP
Start an agent:
.B sudo systemctl start luciverse-<agent>
.TP
View agent logs:
.B journalctl -u luciverse-<agent> -f
.TP
List all running agents:
.B systemctl list-units --type=service --state=running | grep luciverse
.SH FALLBACK PROCEDURES
If an agent fails:
.PP
1. Check service status: systemctl status luciverse-<agent>
.br
2. View logs: journalctl -u luciverse-<agent> -n 50
.br
3. Restart service: sudo systemctl restart luciverse-<agent>
.br
4. If persistent failure, check coherence: python3 ~/.claude/skills/agent-mesh/scripts/temporal-state-persistence.py status
.br
5. Manual state restore: python3 ~/.claude/skills/agent-mesh/scripts/temporal-state-persistence.py restore
.SH COHERENCE
All agents maintain coherence threshold of >= 0.7.
.PP
Genesis Bond frequency: 741 Hz
.br
Coherence decay model: Exponential (24h half-life)
.br
Floor: 0.3 (prevents cold start failures)
